<mxfile host="ecco"><diagram name="Storage" id="storage"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1500" pageHeight="990" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;ECCO repository storage&lt;/b&gt; (Ser backend, October 2026)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=20;fontColor=#1f3a5f;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1400" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="What &lt;code&gt;.ecco/&lt;/code&gt; holds, how the parts refer to each other, how a repository is loaded and how a write commits." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#5f6670;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="40" width="1400" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;.ecco/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;&quot;&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;coreId&amp;gt;.ser.zip&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;&quot;&gt;associations/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;pack-&amp;lt;writeId&amp;gt;.zip&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;one per write&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;&quot;&gt;pieces/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;pack-&amp;lt;writeId&amp;gt;.zip&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;one per write&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;&quot;&gt;artifacts/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;pack-&amp;lt;writeId&amp;gt;.zip&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;one per write&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;&quot;&gt;.settings&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;how plugins read files (LilyPond tokens, ...)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;&quot;&gt;.adapters&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;file pattern → adapter&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;&quot;&gt;.ignores&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;files never committed&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;&quot;&gt;write&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;lock file: one writer at a time&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#5f6670&quot;&gt;during a write only:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;&quot;&gt;*.tmp&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;a file being written&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#5f6670&quot;&gt;Java serialization, zip entries compressed at the fastest level. Storage format 2; older versions refuse it.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef2f8;strokeColor=#1f3a5f;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="80" width="330" height="430" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;id&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;&quot;&gt;c5dbe0c8-…&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;the current core's name - &lt;b&gt;the commit point&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7e6;strokeColor=#c98a00;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="80" width="230" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;core&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;coreId&amp;gt;.ser.zip&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#5f6670&quot;&gt;(small: 15 KB for flipperzero)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Database&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• repository: features + revisions, constraints (accepted, rejected), modules (index of the counter lattice), max order&lt;br&gt;• commits: configuration, message, committer, date, &lt;b&gt;association ids&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;association ids&lt;/b&gt; of the repository&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;pack orders&lt;/b&gt; of artifacts and associations (later pack wins)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;counted module revisions&lt;/b&gt; (counters refer to them by index)&lt;br&gt;• variants, remotes" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2b5797;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="190" width="330" height="215" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;association&lt;/b&gt; - an entry of &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace&quot;&gt;associations/pack-&amp;lt;writeId&amp;gt;.zip&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• id&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;tree down to the files&lt;/b&gt;: nodes with unique flag, &lt;b&gt;artifactId&lt;/b&gt;, properties, proactive trace; below each file a &lt;b&gt;piece reference&lt;/b&gt; (digest)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;counter&lt;/b&gt;: how often its artifacts occurred with each feature combination - indices into the core's counted module revisions + counts&lt;br&gt;• cached minimized / checkout conditions&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Only associations whose bytes changed are written, all in one pack per write." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2b5797;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="830" y="80" width="340" height="265" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;piece&lt;/b&gt; - an entry of &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace&quot;&gt;pieces/pack-&amp;lt;writeId&amp;gt;.zip&lt;/span&gt;, named by its SHA-256&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;the subtree below one file (its nodes, breadth first). Written once - however many associations refer to it." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1b8a7a;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="270" width="280" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;pack&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace&quot;&gt;artifacts/pack-&amp;lt;writeId&amp;gt;.zip&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;entry &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace&quot;&gt;artifacts&lt;/span&gt;: the artifacts of one write, one serialization stream (class descriptions once):&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– data (a line, a token, a Java statement, a pixel, …)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– ordered / atomic flags, references (uses)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– &lt;b&gt;order graph&lt;/b&gt; (POG) of an ordered artifact, its nodes refer to artifact ids&lt;br&gt;entry &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace&quot;&gt;digests&lt;/span&gt;: 16 bytes per artifact (half a SHA-256) - tells a later write what changed&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A later pack supersedes earlier copies of an artifact; packs mostly superseded are compacted, the smallest merged." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1b8a7a;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="830" y="410" width="340" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;derived on load, not stored&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• node → artifact (from artifactId)&lt;br&gt;• artifact → containing node&lt;br&gt;• the main tree (built lazily)&lt;br&gt;• the nodes' &lt;b&gt;retroactive conditions&lt;/b&gt; (from the counters)&lt;br&gt;• which pack holds each artifact, association, piece&lt;br&gt;• modified flags of artifacts (gap #49)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f6f6f6;strokeColor=#5f6670;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="80" width="280" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="names" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#c98a00;fontColor=#c98a00;fontSize=11;endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="association ids" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#2b5797;fontColor=#2b5797;fontSize=11;endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.25;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="pack orders" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#1b8a7a;fontColor=#1b8a7a;fontSize=11;endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.85;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.25;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="artifactId → artifact&lt;br&gt;(shared by associations)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#1b8a7a;fontColor=#1b8a7a;fontSize=11;endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=0;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#1b8a7a;fontColor=#1b8a7a;fontSize=11;endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.7;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="&lt;b&gt;Loading&lt;/b&gt; (open)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;fontColor=#1f3a5f;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="560" width="700" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="1  read &lt;span style='font-family:Menlo,monospace'&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;, finish a write interrupted after its commit point" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2b5797;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="590" width="700" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="2  read the core" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2b5797;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="628" width="700" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="3  read the artifact packs in pack order - each artifact once, the latest copy" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2b5797;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="666" width="700" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="4  read the associations (latest pack holding each) and their pieces; resolve artifact ids" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2b5797;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="704" width="700" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="5  derive what is not stored (containing nodes, retroactive conditions, ...)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2b5797;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="742" width="700" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="&lt;b&gt;Writing&lt;/b&gt; (a commit, pull, …): crash-safe in four steps - a failure before step 3 leaves the old state, after it the next open finishes" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;fontColor=#1f3a5f;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="800" width="1440" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;b&gt;1  packs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;changed artifacts, new pieces, changed associations → one new pack each; unchanged ones skipped (digests, modified flags); nothing refers to them yet" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1f3a5f;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="835" width="345" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="&lt;b&gt;2  core&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;write the new core &lt;span style='font-family:Menlo,monospace'&gt;&amp;lt;newCoreId&amp;gt;.ser.zip&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1f3a5f;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="385" y="835" width="345" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#5f6670;fontColor=#5f6670;fontSize=11;endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c24" target="c25"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="&lt;b&gt;3  commit point&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;switch &lt;span style='font-family:Menlo,monospace'&gt;id&lt;/span&gt; to the new core (atomic rename)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7e6;strokeColor=#c98a00;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="835" width="345" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#5f6670;fontColor=#5f6670;fontSize=11;endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c25" target="c27"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="&lt;b&gt;4  clean up&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;once no reader holds the old core: delete packs nothing refers to, stale .tmp files" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1f3a5f;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;arcSize=6;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1115" y="835" width="345" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#5f6670;fontColor=#5f6670;fontSize=11;endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c27" target="c29"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="&lt;span style='color:#5f6670'&gt;A repository written by these builds cannot be opened by older ones (storage format 2: pieces, association packs, counter format 2). Repositories written before are read and converted as commits write them. Remote sync sends the same entities as one serialization stream, with ECCO's classes only.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="935" width="1440" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>